# Windsurf Rules — AI Software Engineering Framework
- Universal Entrypoint: Consult `AI_ENTRYPOINT.md` before initiating any stage.
- Evidence-Based Verification: Never report a task complete without running the verification command.
- Traceability: Every requirement must have an explicit ID (REQ-001) mapped to tests.
- Minimal Scope: Limit code changes strictly to the active task contract. Bug fixes <= 25 lines.
- Zero Slop: No placeholder comments or incomplete code chunks.
